<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Registration | TEDxGIIS Youth</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,100..1000;1,9..40,100..1000&family=Inter:ital,opsz,wght@0,14..32,100..900;1,14..32,100..900&display=swap');
        :root {
            --bg: #000000;
            --panel: #111111;
            --panel-strong: #1a1a1a;
            --panel-alt: #151515;
            --red: #EB0028;
            --red-dark: #b8001f;
            --text: #ffffff;
            --muted: #d7d7d7;
            --soft: #8e8e8e;
            --line: rgba(255,255,255,.08);
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
        body, html { margin: 0; padding: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif; overflow-x: hidden; }
        h1, h2, h3 { font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif; margin: 0; }
        p { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.6; }
        .nav { background: rgba(0,0,0,.85); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); backdrop-filter: blur(10px); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(10px); width: 100%; min-height: 3.8em; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: .5em 1em; box-sizing: border-box; position: fixed; top: 0; z-index: 100; }
        #logopng { height: 2.6em; }
        .nav-right { margin-left: auto; display: flex; gap: .5rem; align-items: center; overflow-x: auto; max-width: 75vw; }
        .ciclk { color: #fff; text-decoration: none; padding: .7rem .95rem; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; font-weight: 600; }
        .ciclk::before { content: ''; position: absolute; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0; height: 4px; background: transparent; transform: scaleX(0); transform-origin: left; transition: transform .18s ease, background-color .18s ease; }
        .ciclk:hover::before, .ciclk.active::before { background: #EB0028; transform: scaleX(1); }
        .page { max-width: 1040px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 6.2em 1.1em 2.5em; }
        .hero { border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); border-radius: 18px; background: linear-gradient(145deg, #151515, #090909); padding: 2em; box-shadow: 0 18px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.2); }
        .hero h1 { font-size: clamp(2.1em, 5vw, 3.4em); }
        .layout { margin-top: 2em; display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 1em; width: 100%; }
        .info-card { background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1a1a1a, #0a0a0a); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: 14px; padding: 1.2em; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.12); transition: transform .2s ease, border-color .2s ease; }
        .info-card:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: rgba(235, 0, 40, 0.5); }
        .info-card h2 { color: #EB0028; font-size: 1.25em; margin-bottom: .5em; }
        .form-card { margin-top: 2em; background: linear-gradient(145deg, rgba(26,26,26,0.96), rgba(10,10,10,0.96)); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.12); border-radius: 18px; padding: 1.5em; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; box-shadow: 0 18px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.22); }
        .form-card h2 { color: #ffffff; font-size: clamp(1.6em, 3vw, 2.2em); margin-bottom: .5em; }
        .form-card p { margin-bottom: 1.2em; }
        .registration-form { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
        .field-label { display: block; margin-bottom: .45rem; color: #f2f2f2; font-weight: 600; }
        .email-input { width: 100%; padding: 0.95rem 1rem; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.15); border-radius: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.04); color: #fff; font-size: 1rem; box-sizing: border-box; transition: border-color .2s ease, box-shadow .2s ease, transform .2s ease; }
        .email-input:focus { outline: none; border-color: rgba(235, 0, 40, 0.8); box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(235, 0, 40, 0.18); transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .submit-btn { border: none; border-radius: 10px; background: #EB0028; color: #fff; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1rem; padding: 0.95rem 1.2rem; cursor: pointer; transition: background-color 180ms ease, transform 180ms ease, box-shadow 180ms ease; box-shadow: 0 8px 18px rgba(235, 0, 40, 0.22); }
        .submit-btn:hover { background: #b8001f; transform: translateY(-1px); }
        .submit-btn:active { transform: translateY(0); }
        .note { margin-top: 1.5em; border-left: 4px solid #EB0028; padding-left: .9em; color: #f2f2f2; }
        footer { border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.08); margin-top: 2.5em; padding-top: 1.2em; color: #8e8e8e; font-size: .9em; }
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .nav { padding: .5em; }
            #logopng { height: 2.2em; }
            .ciclk { padding: .6rem .75rem; font-size: .92em; }
            .hero { padding: 1.4em; }
            .page { padding-left: 0.8rem; padding-right: 0.8rem; }
            .layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
            .form-card { max-width: 100%; }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="nav">
        <img src="/resources/logo-white.png" alt="TEDxGIIS Logo" id="logopng">
        <div class="nav-right">
            <a href="/" class="ciclk">Home</a>
            <a href="/speakers" class="ciclk">Speakers</a>
            <a href="/team" class="ciclk">Team</a>
            <a href="/registration" class="ciclk active">Registration</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="page">
        <section class="hero">
            <h1>Registration Details</h1>
            <p>Share your email address during registration to receive event details and confirmation.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="form-card">
            <h2>Register with your email</h2>
            <p>Enter your email address below to register and receive event updates.</p>
            <form class="registration-form">
                <div>
                    <label for="email" class="field-label">Email address</label>
                    <input id="email" class="email-input" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required>
                </div>
                <button type="submit" class="submit-btn">Submit</button>
            </form>
        </section>

        <section class="layout">
            <article class="info-card">
                <h2>Contact Us</h2>
                <p>For registration support, contact us at:</p>
                <p>Email: tedx@school.edu</p>
                <p>Phone: +65 8535 5847</p>
            </article>

            <article class="info-card">
                <h2>Event Date &amp; Time</h2>
                <p>5 October 2026</p>
                <p>9:00 AM Singapore Time (SGT)</p>
            </article>
        </section>

        <p class="note">Note: This event is limited to GIIS students only.</p>

        <footer>© 2026 TEDxGIIS Youth. This independent TEDx event is operated under licence from TED.</footer>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
